This package adapts the TypeSafe Jev client originally written for Symfony AI.

The HTTP request shape, decision types (`noul`, `choice`, `score`), result
conversion, and tests come from that work. Adapted files keep their Symfony
copyright headers.

Darkwood AI does not reimplement Symfony AI Platform contracts. This package
depends on `symfony/ai-platform` and lives under the
`Darkwood\AI\Platform\Bridge\Jev` namespace.
